    CloseDialogAfterThis: 0
  - NodeGUID: 85804190-113f-4e07-8f40-4dd642c41a98
    DialogueText: 
    Position: {x: 1103.2, y: 214.40001}
    Choices:
    - "Ad\u0131m\u0131 nereden biliyorsun?"
    - "Ad\u0131m\u0131 s\xF6yledi\u011Fine g\xF6re beni tan\u0131yorsun."
    ReputationChanges: 0000000000000000
    EntryPoint: 0
    IsEndNode: 0
    IsPlayerNode: 1
    CloseDialogAfterThis: 0
  - NodeGUID: 3cd00eaf-05a9-46e6-9d01-d7538ebf5f5b
    DialogueText: "Pek \xE7ok \u015Fey bilirim."
    Position: {x: 1615.2, y: 420.80002}
    Choices: []
    ReputationChanges: 
    EntryPoint: 0
    IsEndNode: 0
    IsPlayerNode: 0
    CloseDialogAfterThis: 0
  - NodeGUID: 4a181d6e-8490-4635-8494-435a374b4855
    DialogueText: "Sand\u0131\u011F\u0131ndan fazlas\u0131n\u0131 duydum, \xF6\u011Frendim."
    Position: {x: 1632.8, y: 122.4}
    Choices: []
    ReputationChanges: 
    EntryPoint: 0
    IsEndNode: 0
    IsPlayerNode: 0
    CloseDialogAfterThis: 0
  - NodeGUID: 081e7171-f274-4a02-a693-ad3e6cd9360a
    DialogueText: "Selam evlat. Senin ad\u0131n Arthur'du, yan\u0131lm\u0131yorum
      de\u011Fil mi?"
    Position: {x: 740, y: 211.20001}
    Choices: []
    ReputationChanges: 
    EntryPoint: 0
    IsEndNode: 0
    IsPlayerNode: 0
    CloseDialogAfterThis: 0
  - NodeGUID: d6a0a373-da9b-409b-b444-7eadd59f9144
    DialogueText: "Merhaba o\u011Flum. Arthur\u2019du de\u011Fil mi?"
    Position: {x: 742.4, y: 467.2}
    Choices: []
    ReputationChanges: 
    EntryPoint: 0
    IsEndNode: 0
    IsPlayerNode: 0
    CloseDialogAfterThis: 0
  - NodeGUID: 21b157f9-e7bf-4889-baed-9313d3785b0e
    DialogueText: 
    Position: {x: 208.8, y: 214.40001}
    Choices:
    - Merhaba ihtiyar.
    - ' Merhaba.'
    ReputationChanges: 0000000000000000
    EntryPoint: 0
    IsEndNode: 0
    IsPlayerNode: 1
    CloseDialogAfterThis: 0
  - NodeGUID: baa6fcfb-234b-405e-a415-eeb501441a32
    DialogueText: 
    Position: {x: 1936, y: 280}
    Choices:
    - " Buras\u0131 neden bu halde?"
    - Burada neler oldu?
    ReputationChanges: 0000000000000000
    EntryPoint: 0
    IsEndNode: 0
    IsPlayerNode: 1
    CloseDialogAfterThis: 0
  - NodeGUID: acc2f2f4-4292-4d73-ab96-9b4b9c32adb5
    DialogueText: "\u015Eu kap\u0131y\u0131 g\xF6r\xFCyor musun? Oran\u0131n ard\u0131nda
      kadim zamanlardan kalan zindanlar var. Krall\u0131k buray\u0131 kapatt\u0131
      ve kilidini bana verdi. Oysaki ben de burada mahkumdum. O zamandan beridir
      koruyorum buray\u0131. Neden korudu\u011Fumu bile unuttum. Sonra buran\u0131n
      ard\u0131nda bir salg\u0131n ba\u015Flad\u0131. Her yerden mantarlar f\u0131\u015Fk\u0131rmaya
      ba\u015Flad\u0131 o\u011Flum. Gardiyanlar da ka\xE7t\u0131 gitti."
    Position: {x: 2451.2, y: -25.6}
    Choices: []
    ReputationChanges: 
    EntryPoint: 0
    IsEndNode: 0
    IsPlayerNode: 0
    CloseDialogAfterThis: 0
  - NodeGUID: 1c85867e-7323-47e1-91fd-f181e8e2469e
    DialogueText: " Zindan\u0131 arkandaki b\xFCy\xFCk kap\u0131n\u0131n ard\u0131na
      m\xFCh\xFCrlediler. Bir zamanlar ben de buran\u0131n tutsa\u011F\u0131yd\u0131m,
      ama sonra bana bu lanetli yerin anahtar\u0131n\u0131 verdiler. Y\u0131llar
      ge\xE7ti, salg\u0131n ba\u015Flad\u0131, mantarlar istilaya ba\u015Flad\u0131.
      G\xF6zc\xFCler korkup ka\xE7t\u0131."
    Position: {x: 2468.8, y: 410.4}
    Choices: []
    ReputationChanges: 
    EntryPoint: 0
    IsEndNode: 0
    IsPlayerNode: 0
    CloseDialogAfterThis: 0
  - NodeGUID: 2c3f6130-a59b-4d91-9487-328b6ca05b81
    DialogueText: 
    Position: {x: 3773.6, y: 324.80002}
    Choices:
    - "Anlad\u0131m \u0130htiyar. Buradan \xE7\u0131kman\u0131n bir yolu yok mu peki?"
    - "Peki ama buradan nas\u0131l kurtulabilirim?"
    ReputationChanges: 0000000000000000
    EntryPoint: 0
    IsEndNode: 0
    IsPlayerNode: 1
    CloseDialogAfterThis: 0
  - NodeGUID: 4eb38015-ed05-4dfe-bf0a-cb10c86fd053
    DialogueText: "Zindanlardan oldu\u011Fu gibi \xE7\u0131kamazs\u0131n. Kimse i\xE7eriyi
      umursamasa da d\u0131\u015Far\u0131s\u0131n\u0131 \xE7evrelediler. Zindan\u0131n
      derinliklerinden ka\xE7arsan belki ka\xE7ars\u0131n."
    Position: {x: 4392.8, y: 64}
    Choices: []
    ReputationChanges: 
    EntryPoint: 0
    IsEndNode: 0
    IsPlayerNode: 0
    CloseDialogAfterThis: 0
  - NodeGUID: 1c8808a8-5f6d-4d52-9896-845da6be902d
    DialogueText: "Zindandan do\u011Frudan \xE7\u0131kmak imkans\u0131z. D\u0131\u015Far\u0131s\u0131
      h\xE2l\xE2 korunuyor. Ama a\u015Fa\u011F\u0131ya, derinlere inersen... orada
      bir umut olabilir."
    Position: {x: 4300, y: 600}
    Choices: []
    ReputationChanges: 
    EntryPoint: 0
    IsEndNode: 0
    IsPlayerNode: 0
    CloseDialogAfterThis: 0
  - NodeGUID: 1ee71dc4-7011-4bdc-acea-0065792a52f6
    DialogueText: 
    Position: {x: 5100.8, y: 405.6}
    Choices:
    - "Zindan\u0131n derinliklerinden nas\u0131l ka\xE7\u0131l\u0131r peki? Nereden
      biliyorsun bunu?"
    - "Bunu nereden biliyorsun? Derinliklerde ne oldu\u011Funu g\xF6rd\xFCn m\xFC?"
    ReputationChanges: 0000000000000000
    EntryPoint: 0
    IsEndNode: 0
    IsPlayerNode: 1
    CloseDialogAfterThis: 0
  - NodeGUID: 8a960bee-3eae-4652-a624-569ab5e479d4
    DialogueText: "Bu koridorlar\u0131n sessizli\u011Fi bile \xE7\u0131\u011Fl\u0131k
      dolu o\u011Flum. Pek \xE7ok ki\u015Fi kap\u0131ya y\xFCr\xFCmeye kalkt\u0131,
      kimse geri d\xF6nmedi. Ama biri... biri derinliklere indi. B\xFCy\xFCk bir
      sava\u015F\xE7\u0131yd\u0131. Geri d\xF6nd\xFC\u011F\xFCnde... sanki ruhu i\xE7eride
      kalm\u0131\u015F gibiydi. Sadece, \u201CSonunda bir ge\xE7it var, terk edilmi\u015F,\u201D
      dedi. Ama oradan neden \xE7\u0131kmad\u0131\u011F\u0131n\u0131 hi\xE7birimiz
      anlayamad\u0131k. G\xF6zleri her \u015Feyi anlat\u0131yordu."
    Position: {x: 5594.4, y: 660.8}
    Choices: []
    ReputationChanges: 
    EntryPoint: 0
    IsEndNode: 0
    IsPlayerNode: 0
    CloseDialogAfterThis: 0
  - NodeGUID: 5b1ca9e4-2d7b-40af-9cc0-235f4c068e26
    DialogueText: "Buralar neden bo\u015F san\u0131yorsun? Herkes bir \xE7\u0131k\u0131\u015F
      yolu denedi. Kap\u0131dan y\xFCr\xFCy\xFCp \xE7\u0131kmaya \xE7al\u0131\u015Fanlar\u0131n
      da zindana girenlerin de ac\u0131 \xE7\u0131\u011Fl\u0131klar\u0131yla yank\u0131land\u0131
      bu koridorlar. Ancak birisi zindan\u0131n derinliklerine inmeyi ba\u015Fard\u0131
      o\u011Flum. \xC7ok g\xFC\xE7l\xFC biriydi, ama geri d\xF6nd\xFC derinliklerden.
      Harap olmu\u015Ftu kocaman adam. Ben de d\xF6n\xFC\u015F\xFCne \u015Fahit oldum.
      Bana \u2018Buran\u0131n sonunda bir \xE7\u0131k\u0131\u015F kap\u0131s\u0131
      var. Zaman\u0131nda gardiyanlar oradan girip \xE7\u0131k\u0131yormu\u015F.
      \xC7evresinde de kimseler yok.\u2019 dedi. Neden \xE7\u0131kmad\u0131n diye
      sordu\u011Fumuzda bize cevap vermedi ama g\xF6zlerindeki korku fazlas\u0131yla
      yeterliydi."
    Position: {x: 5592, y: 48.799995}
    Choices: []
    ReputationChanges: 
    EntryPoint: 0
    IsEndNode: 0
    IsPlayerNode: 0
    CloseDialogAfterThis: 0
  - NodeGUID: 059bd663-6afe-4d35-8272-2fe48b0a75f7
    DialogueText: 
    Position: {x: 7568, y: 617.6}
    Choices:
    - "Anlad\u0131m ihtiyar."
    - "Bu dediklerin kula\u011Fa deli sa\xE7mas\u0131 gibi geliyor ama \xF6yle olsun."
    ReputationChanges: 0000000000000000
    EntryPoint: 0
    IsEndNode: 0
    IsPlayerNode: 1
    CloseDialogAfterThis: 0
  - NodeGUID: 94b25908-e74a-4927-b7c2-a66cf117265a
    DialogueText: "Sana bir teklifim var. Hadi bir anla\u015Fma yapal\u0131m. Sen
      bana istediklerimi getir, ben de sana kar\u015F\u0131l\u0131\u011F\u0131nda
      i\u015Fine yarayacak e\u015Fyalar vereyim."
    Position: {x: 8394.4, y: 592.8}
    Choices: []
    ReputationChanges: 
    EntryPoint: 0
    IsEndNode: 0
    IsPlayerNode: 0
    CloseDialogAfterThis: 0
  - NodeGUID: 167bc7a2-b2ad-4875-858d-12f5922f332b
    DialogueText: 
    Position: {x: 9162.4, y: 594.39996}
    Choices:
    - "\u0130\u015Fini de biliyorsun ihtiyar. S\xF6yle bakal\u0131m, ne istiyorsun."
    - "Ne tarz bir sa\xE7mal\u0131k duyaca\u011F\u0131m acaba? Dinliyorum ihtiyar."
    ReputationChanges: 0000000000000000
    EntryPoint: 0
    IsEndNode: 0
    IsPlayerNode: 1
    CloseDialogAfterThis: 0
  - NodeGUID: 8547a275-a0d9-46a8-9e53-afa4047845f3
    DialogueText: "Biraz mavi kristal. 4 - 5 tane \xFCzerinde mantar yeti\u015Fmi\u015F
      kaval kemi\u011Fi. \xD6zellikle mor ve par\u0131ldayan olanlar\u0131ndan bulabilirsen
      g\xFCzel olur. Paslanm\u0131\u015F demir y\xFCz\xFCk, neyden bahsettti\u011Fimi
      g\xF6rd\xFC\u011F\xFCnde anlars\u0131n. Toplayabildi\u011Fin mantar \xE7e\u015Fitlerinin
      hepsi, ne kadar \xE7ok o kadar iyi."
    Position: {x: 9676, y: 586.39996}
    Choices: []
    ReputationChanges: 
    EntryPoint: 0
    IsEndNode: 0
    IsPlayerNode: 0
    CloseDialogAfterThis: 0
  - NodeGUID: 8e3d5932-6326-4db2-a49d-640bd74b6fe7
    DialogueText: 
    Position: {x: 11118.4, y: 616.8}
    Choices:
    - "Bunlar\u0131... Neden istiyorsun?"
    - Neden..?
    ReputationChanges: 0000000000000000
    EntryPoint: 0
    IsEndNode: 0
    IsPlayerNode: 1
    CloseDialogAfterThis: 0
  - NodeGUID: cdb3fa2f-c92c-49de-9d0f-3aa550a7dbaf
    DialogueText: "Oras\u0131 bende kals\u0131n o\u011Flum, sen bana kabul ediyor
      musun onu s\xF6yle."
    Position: {x: 11640.8, y: 601.6}
    Choices: []
    ReputationChanges: 
    EntryPoint: 0
    IsEndNode: 0
    IsPlayerNode: 0
    CloseDialogAfterThis: 0
  - NodeGUID: 366de24d-ff94-411f-a01d-c35dc895f801
    DialogueText: 
    Position: {x: 12103.2, y: 605.6}
    Choices:
    - "Anla\u015Ft\u0131k ihtiyar."
    - "Acaba ba\u015F\u0131ma neler gelecek? Tamam, \xF6yle olsun."
    ReputationChanges: 0000000000000000
    EntryPoint: 0
    IsEndNode: 0
    IsPlayerNode: 1
    CloseDialogAfterThis: 0
  - NodeGUID: 6cd9f246-3649-4d39-9d8c-097f3178e38b
    DialogueText: 
    Position: {x: 12758.4, y: 618.39996}
